      "side": 1,
      "message": "The connect call here is only from WNS. Apps is not in picture. It\u0027s just that the WifiConfiguration selected by WNS has a particular BSSID set by an App. The app could set the BSSID field during or after WifiConfiguration creation. \"BSSID\" is a public field of WifiConfiguration and no setter/getter API, which is another issue though.\n\nNot sure if I get your question right. We can have a face to face chat if needed.",
